  "result": "`slugify` is implemented in `src/strings.js`, and `npm test` passes with all 11 tests green (the 2 existing ones plus 9 new ones).\n\nIt converts đ/Đ to d, strips diacritics, and lowercases. Each run of characters outside a-z and 0-9 becomes one hyphen. Leading hyphens are removed, the result is cut to 50 characters, and any hyphen left at the end after the cut is removed.\n\nThe new tests in `test/strings.test.js` cover:\n- basic lowercasing and hyphenation\n- Vietnamese and other Latin diacritics\n- collapsing runs of symbols\n- trimming hyphens at both ends\n- empty and symbol-only input\n- digits\n- the 50-character cap, including a cut that lands on a hyphen",
